10 REM SPRITE TEST -- A BOUNCING BLOCK
20 FOR I=0 TO 62: POKE 12288+I,255: NEXT I: REM SOLID SPRITE SHAPE
30 POKE 2040,192: REM SPRITE 0 DATA POINTER (12288/64=192)
40 POKE 53287,1: REM SPRITE 0 COLOR = WHITE
50 POKE 53269,1: REM ENABLE SPRITE 0
60 REM X STAYS BELOW 256 -- PAST THAT NEEDS THE X MSB REGISTER TOO
70 X=24: Y=50: DX=2: DY=1
80 POKE 53248,X: POKE 53249,Y
90 X=X+DX: Y=Y+DY
100 IF X<24 OR X>220 THEN DX=-DX
110 IF Y<50 OR Y>229 THEN DY=-DY
120 GOTO 80
